{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raid in Galaxy is a third-person shooter where you pilot a spacecraft to combat mechanical aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maneuver to avoid enemy fire and use 4 types of weapons to destroy them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052970/extras/3ab1427480212ad12e399e829d0b1c21.poster.avif?t=1761899948\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052970/extras/3ab1427480212ad12e399e829d0b1c21.webm?t=1761899948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052970/extras/3ab1427480212ad12e399e829d0b1c21.mp4?t=1761899948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052970/extras/1641842ce42dc3cbefb1f2825757f265.poster.avif?t=1761899948\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052970/extras/1641842ce42dc3cbefb1f2825757f265.webm?t=1761899948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052970/extras/1641842ce42dc3cbefb1f2825757f265.mp4?t=1761899948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can move in six directions and rotate on all six axes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052970/extras/342783d9c095f8f9f53813a3f6a9dc27.poster.avif?t=1761899948\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052970/extras/342783d9c095f8f9f53813a3f6a9dc27.webm?t=1761899948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052970/extras/342783d9c095f8f9f53813a3f6a9dc27.mp4?t=1761899948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can equip both main and sub weapons. Use a variety of weapons to take down your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052970/extras/cfad31b86320beef4598eb5b20f8f634.poster.avif?t=1761899948\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052970/extras/cfad31b86320beef4598eb5b20f8f634.webm?t=1761899948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052970/extras/cfad31b86320beef4598eb5b20f8f634.mp4?t=1761899948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the interaction key while facing certain objects to interact with them\u2014open sealed hatch doors, get items, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052970/extras/5c821d50c26f23efa91f1bd1a234f396.poster.avif?t=1761899948\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052970/extras/5c821d50c26f23efa91f1bd1a234f396.webm?t=1761899948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052970/extras/5c821d50c26f23efa91f1bd1a234f396.mp4?t=1761899948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spacecraft has both Health and Shield. If your Health runs out, the ship is destroyed, and you\u2019ll restart from the last save point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052970/extras/7c2a7f6bde4d6303625c94f7c1617603.poster.avif?t=1761899948\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052970/extras/7c2a7f6bde4d6303625c94f7c1617603.webm?t=1761899948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052970/extras/7c2a7f6bde4d6303625c94f7c1617603.mp4?t=1761899948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various obstacles on the map. Some of them can be destroyed by attacking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the controls of your spacecraft, defeat the invaders, and embark on a journey of vengeance.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You're Under Attack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4052970/bdb0b35a7e4c781f20294ba4784ce08e2c45374e.jpg"},{"name":"Raid in Galaxy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4052970/316b568449bac9d5f77516e4e5f3723dd5e0e656.jpg"},{"name":"Into Space","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4052970/98513000760beefebfc0bc362bd56d5b833ff0c2.jpg"},{"name":"Counter Raid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4052970/bb4a75e436abb364505e11153627e09141b41382.jpg"},{"name":"Giant Killing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4052970/32f19b95c1c34a9d831bf3a2456dcafc3d9cc858.jpg"},{"name":"Last Stronghold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.